        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/d74499c56222c0252e24aa925bdd7007.poster.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/d74499c56222c0252e24aa925bdd7007.webm?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/d74499c56222c0252e24aa925bdd7007.mp4?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Pipetuber’s Guide to the Solar System&quot; is a 2D strategy resource management game with light puzzle and rogue-lite elements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By constructing Pipetubes to obtain various resources, players cope with periodic resource pressures and challenges. Through continuous map exploration, they discover new resources and unique events, thereby building more advanced Pipetube systems, optimizing and expanding them further. The ultimate goal is to successfully pass resource inspections and achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/14b2bc4a815e72407be7e6f76ee0b170.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1560 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome, Pipetuber. I am &lt;The Pipetuber’s Guide to the Solar System&gt;, <u>an APMI (Advacned Pipetuber Management Intercae) from DSRM (Department of System Resource Management)</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/a391dc259b4df46f504edbf6157d8b69.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1560 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/c45e0cee3f58ff2bf0fce57d0473d2b2.poster.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/c45e0cee3f58ff2bf0fce57d0473d2b2.webm?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/c45e0cee3f58ff2bf0fce57d0473d2b2.mp4?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command robots on Moon35 to build and plan Pipetube systems around your base on a randomly generated map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/c4c4c0d1aa12849ce72fe24d8beb41fc.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1560 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/3c188df65364b45180b874745f407841.poster.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/3c188df65364b45180b874745f407841.webm?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/3c188df65364b45180b874745f407841.mp4?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit as much as you can:  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/4b4c3d23609cf60379df8dc08ea463a4.webp?t=1765876256\" width=13 height=16 /></span> <strong>Battery;   </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/a50e5672950bd365fbe6d0eb5ab1e010.webp?t=1765876256\" width=16 height=16 /></span><strong> Steel;   </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/4ac994e61facda074cc282b7ce71b057.webp?t=1765876256\" width=16 height=16 /></span><strong> Crystal;   </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/8c923faab75df81189da4703766ea38b.webp?t=1765876256\" width=16 height=15 /></span><strong> &quot;Butter&quot; (?)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/9767e1e3f21a534dbc2c8f50c8e5042d.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1560 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a DSRM Pipetuber Intern, you should explore Moon35 as the Guide instructed. All purpose is for constructing Backup-Earth42 and your tomorrow Sushi Stuffed Dumpling meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/b149845120a35b2e0690a4f9a5d4a5a0.poster.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/b149845120a35b2e0690a4f9a5d4a5a0.webm?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/b149845120a35b2e0690a4f9a5d4a5a0.mp4?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be noticed: that all DSRM Pipetubers must upgrade &lt;03 Cumulative Update for the Pipetuber’s Guide to the Solar System Version 25H1&gt;. This upgrade version has following differences: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firstly, it can better demonstrate the KPI of every Pipetuber;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondly, there is a quote on the starting window, written in large, friendly letters, “Butter is the most useful substance on Moon35.”</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you run into any problems or bugs during gameplay, feel free to join our official Discord server to discuss with us:7rnEucaw </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/d74499c56222c0252e24aa925bdd7007.poster.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/d74499c56222c0252e24aa925bdd7007.webm?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/d74499c56222c0252e24aa925bdd7007.mp4?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Pipetuber’s Guide to the Solar System&quot; is a 2D strategy resource management game with light puzzle and rogue-lite elements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By constructing Pipetubes to obtain various resources, players cope with periodic resource pressures and challenges. Through continuous map exploration, they discover new resources and unique events, thereby building more advanced Pipetube systems, optimizing and expanding them further. The ultimate goal is to successfully pass resource inspections and achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/14b2bc4a815e72407be7e6f76ee0b170.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1560 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome, Pipetuber. I am &lt;The Pipetuber’s Guide to the Solar System&gt;, <u>an APMI (Advacned Pipetuber Management Intercae) from DSRM (Department of System Resource Management)</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/a391dc259b4df46f504edbf6157d8b69.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1560 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/c45e0cee3f58ff2bf0fce57d0473d2b2.poster.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/c45e0cee3f58ff2bf0fce57d0473d2b2.webm?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/c45e0cee3f58ff2bf0fce57d0473d2b2.mp4?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command robots on Moon35 to build and plan Pipetube systems around your base on a randomly generated map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/c4c4c0d1aa12849ce72fe24d8beb41fc.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1560 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/3c188df65364b45180b874745f407841.poster.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/3c188df65364b45180b874745f407841.webm?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/3c188df65364b45180b874745f407841.mp4?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit as much as you can:  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/4b4c3d23609cf60379df8dc08ea463a4.webp?t=1765876256\" width=13 height=16 /></span> <strong>Battery;   </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/a50e5672950bd365fbe6d0eb5ab1e010.webp?t=1765876256\" width=16 height=16 /></span><strong> Steel;   </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/4ac994e61facda074cc282b7ce71b057.webp?t=1765876256\" width=16 height=16 /></span><strong> Crystal;   </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/8c923faab75df81189da4703766ea38b.webp?t=1765876256\" width=16 height=15 /></span><strong> &quot;Butter&quot; (?)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/9767e1e3f21a534dbc2c8f50c8e5042d.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1560 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a DSRM Pipetuber Intern, you should explore Moon35 as the Guide instructed. All purpose is for constructing Backup-Earth42 and your tomorrow Sushi Stuffed Dumpling meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/b149845120a35b2e0690a4f9a5d4a5a0.poster.avif?t=1765876256\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/b149845120a35b2e0690a4f9a5d4a5a0.webm?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837210/extras/b149845120a35b2e0690a4f9a5d4a5a0.mp4?t=1765876256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be noticed: that all DSRM Pipetubers must upgrade &lt;03 Cumulative Update for the Pipetuber’s Guide to the Solar System Version 25H1&gt;. This upgrade version has following differences: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firstly, it can better demonstrate the KPI of every Pipetuber;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondly, there is a quote on the starting window, written in large, friendly letters, “Butter is the most useful substance on Moon35.”</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you run into any problems or bugs during gameplay, feel free to join our official Discord server to discuss with us:7rnEucaw </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
